	(text "C54 = Nichicon UES1H470MPM, 47u / 50V bipolar, 10 x 20 mm.\nWire across J18 pins 1-2. It is in series with CH2 positive.\nFor stereo: remove capacitor harness and fit a rated shorting link.\nWith neither cap nor link, CH2 positive is OPEN (safe no-output).\nPin 1 = filtered bridge positive; pin 2 = speaker connector positive.\nNeither pin is ground. Change link only with power off.\nNominal 4 ohm pole ~847 Hz; actual response follows tweeter impedance.\nAccount for capacitor phase/response in the DSP crossover."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20c5d0de-27eb-4bb1-bce5-69d6a3653bff")
	)
