		(uuid "7ed2b222-041d-4582-8475-912af6385820")
	)
	(text "SNUBBERS C41-C44 / R35-R38: DNP, tune on bench.\nTI starting point 330p / 18R; no copied TPA3220 snubber.\nAll filtered speaker terminals float relative to GND.\nRoute source-side input reference returns to the DAC GND.\nPower loops must not share those return traces."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7fd764e0-4517-4ef2-895e-d4beb89671d1")
	)
	(text "SDZ default LOW; MUTE default HIGH. 10k/100n command filtering\nlimits slew below TI 10 V/ms. SDZ asserted low is the primary safe state.\nMUTE command HIGH=mute, LOW=play. Wait >=50 ms after SDZ high\nbefore unmuting. FAULTZ open-drain -> GPIO35, 100k pull-up.\nNo automatic retry link: log fault, mute, cycle SDZ only after diagnosis."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "846f7769-5fb7-4885-b4a5-d0c6b703b099")
	)
	(text "TPA3126D2 - STEREO BTL / 4 OHM LOADS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca3ce5ca-48bd-4232-95db-3eeab68a11bd")
	)
	(text "PLIMIT IS PROVISIONAL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb240ddc-4d03-4c2b-9b0e-839946d9d3d3")
	)
	(text "TWEETER: DAC RIGHT -> AMPLIFIER LEFT BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccfb7fc2-4043-4acd-9373-efb3a9f5ac46")
	)
	(text "20 dB MASTER; AM[2:0]=000 -> 400 kHz nominal. MODSEL=0 -> hybrid mode.\nEach CSAD package: winding 1-2, winding 4-3. No assumed flux cancellation.\nTI Fig.31 filter: 10u per leg + 680n to GND per leg (four film capacitors total).\nKeep 20 x 18 x 10 mm heatsink clearance over U1; top PowerPAD, no PCB EP copper.\nTop pad may be grounded (preferred) or floating per TI; never connect it to PVDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e04d687e-88b1-4459-b6f7-7e1a52793e97")
	)
	(text "100k/33k: VPLIMIT = 0.2481 x GVDD = 1.39 V nominal.\nTI virtual-rail model: Vpk ~5.56 V; ~3.4 W sine / 4 ohm\nafter series loss. TI table 3 RMS labels conflict with this model.\nMeasure actual clipping/limit into dummy loads at 12 and 16 V.\nShared limiter cannot protect each driver or define safe excursion.\nInput pad: 3k3/1k plus DAC 470R -> ~0.206 gain, ~4.3 Vrms\nrequested at DAC FS and 20 dB (before PLIMIT). Keep DSP limits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 207.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e9958a0f-cfde-407b-b065-7b20b73e674f")
	)
